      "body": "@davtoro, if it is all just \"outer loop\" refinement, then does this mean it is similar to universal transformers? (not gonna comment on data augmentation since that is just a self-consistency thing) https://arxiv.org/pdf/1807.03819 \nAlso, why do these two pop into my head? https://arxiv.org/html/2502.05171v2 https://arxiv.org/html/2412.06769 https://www.themoonlight.io/en/review/reasoning-beyond-language-a-comprehensive-survey-on-latent-chain-of-thought-reasoning\nP.S. Please mix HRM with Diffusion models, can't wait to see how that could pan out https://github.com/Jianguo99/OpenDLM",
