      "body": "Man I whish I could enter, but we can't expose IP.  But our fork of HRM has achieved 100% solves out of 1000 puzzles in every domain and will run 5000 Sudoku Puzzles on a RTX-1650 for my long run analysis, this image is from a RTX-3050!   And for everyone to understand, this isn't a fake and soon there will be a live video of the runs, the best I can do.  Attempts == EPOCHS\n<img width=\"1425\" height=\"790\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef520105-f894-4d14-af24-782bcb1af73c\" />",
